# Cardly React Native (Expo) client

The mobile app lives in **`C:/projects/cardly/cardly-rnative-app`**. When coordinating API contracts, auth, or mobile UX with this backend, apply the sections below to that codebase.

## Language and locale

- **Project** material under `docs/agents/` in the mobile repo, academic report text, and user-facing documentation where applicable: **pt-BR**.
- **Source code** (identifiers, developer-facing strings, tests), **Git commit messages**, **Cursor rules**, and **agent instructions**: **en-US**.
- **In-app UI copy** for end users in the mobile app: **pt-BR** unless the product standardizes on another locale later.

## Code and commits

- **Do not add comments** in source code (TypeScript, JavaScript, etc.). Prefer clear names and small functions.
- **Do not use emojis** in **git commit messages** or suggested merge/PR titles.
